From bcf7f6dbffa704cac41b462c55325b89b67a4eed Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 23:49:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2800/3799] soh: rename D_80116280 -> sXluRenderModeDList

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: a display list setting the translucent fog render mode and alpha compare, bound as segment 0x0C by several actors
Defined in soh/src/code/z_actor.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
